# Dragon Magazine Compendium - the Oriental Adventures shaman domains for the Shaman (DMC) (realmshelps.net).
# Spells existing only in other books are added by dmc_shaman_domains_opt*.lst when such a book is loaded.

Ancestor (Shaman)	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Ancestor (Shaman)	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|Ancestor (Shaman)=1|Detect Undead|Ancestor (Shaman)=3|Speak with Dead|Ancestor (Shaman)=4|Divination|Ancestor (Shaman)=5|Atonement|Ancestor (Shaman)=6|Geas/Quest|Ancestor (Shaman)=7|Legend Lore|Ancestor (Shaman)=9|Foresight	SOURCEPAGE:Oriental Adventures	DESC:A number of times per day equal to your Charisma bonus (minimum once), you can summon an ancestor and channel some of its karmic power: a +4 insight bonus on any skill check.
Celestial (Shaman)	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Celestial (Shaman)	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|Celestial (Shaman)=1|Bless|Celestial (Shaman)=7|Dictum|Celestial (Shaman)=9|Gate	SOURCEPAGE:Oriental Adventures	DESC:Rebuke or command spirits as an evil cleric rebukes undead, a number of times per day equal to 1 + your Charisma modifier.
Community (Shaman)	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Community (Shaman)	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|Community (Shaman)=1|Bless|Community (Shaman)=2|Shield Other|Community (Shaman)=3|Prayer|Community (Shaman)=4|Status|Community (Shaman)=5|Telepathic Bond|Community (Shaman)=6|Heroes' Feast|Community (Shaman)=7|Refuge|Community (Shaman)=8|Heal (Mass)|Community (Shaman)=9|Miracle	SOURCEPAGE:Oriental Adventures	DESC:Use calm emotions as a spell-like ability once per day; +2 competence bonus on Diplomacy checks.
Divination (Shaman)	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Divination (Shaman)	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|Divination (Shaman)=1|Identify|Divination (Shaman)=2|Augury|Divination (Shaman)=3|Divination|Divination (Shaman)=4|Scrying|Divination (Shaman)=6|Legend Lore|Divination (Shaman)=7|Scrying (Greater)|Divination (Shaman)=8|Discern Location|Divination (Shaman)=9|Foresight	SOURCEPAGE:Oriental Adventures	DESC:You cast divination spells at +2 caster level.
Flame (Shaman)	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Flame (Shaman)	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|Flame (Shaman)=1|Burning Hands|Flame (Shaman)=2|Produce Flame|Flame (Shaman)=4|Wall of Fire|Flame (Shaman)=6|Fire Seeds|Flame (Shaman)=7|Fire Storm|Flame (Shaman)=8|Incendiary Cloud	SOURCEPAGE:Oriental Adventures	DESC:Flame ward, once per day (spell-like, standard action, abjuration): you or a creature touched gains a resistance bonus equal to your shaman level on saves against fire spells and effects for 1 minute + 1 minute/level.
Fortune (Shaman)	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Fortune (Shaman)	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|Fortune (Shaman)=1|Entropic Shield|Fortune (Shaman)=2|Aid|Fortune (Shaman)=4|Freedom of Movement|Fortune (Shaman)=5|Break Enchantment|Fortune (Shaman)=6|Mislead|Fortune (Shaman)=7|Spell Turning|Fortune (Shaman)=9|Miracle	SOURCEPAGE:Oriental Adventures	DESC:Good fortune, once per day (extraordinary): reroll one roll you have just made; you must take the reroll.
Fury (Shaman)	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Fury (Shaman)	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|Fury (Shaman)=2|Shatter|Fury (Shaman)=4|Shout|Fury (Shaman)=5|Inflict Light Wounds (Mass)|Fury (Shaman)=6|Harm|Fury (Shaman)=7|Destruction|Fury (Shaman)=8|Earthquake|Fury (Shaman)=9|Implosion	SOURCEPAGE:Oriental Adventures	DESC:Smite, once per day (supernatural): a single melee attack with a +4 attack bonus and a damage bonus equal to your shaman level; declare before the attack.
Grave (Shaman)	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Grave (Shaman)	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|Grave (Shaman)=2|Death Knell|Grave (Shaman)=3|Animate Dead|Grave (Shaman)=5|Slay Living|Grave (Shaman)=6|Create Undead|Grave (Shaman)=7|Destruction|Grave (Shaman)=8|Create Greater Undead|Grave (Shaman)=9|Wail of the Banshee	SOURCEPAGE:Oriental Adventures	DESC:Death touch, once per day (spell-like, death effect): on a melee touch attack against a living creature roll 1d6 per shaman level; if the total at least equals its current hit points, it dies.
Guardian (Shaman)	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Guardian (Shaman)	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|Guardian (Shaman)=1|Shield of Faith|Guardian (Shaman)=5|Dispel Chaos,Dispel Evil,Dispel Good,Dispel Law|Guardian (Shaman)=6|Stoneskin|Guardian (Shaman)=7|Repulsion|Guardian (Shaman)=9|Antipathy	SOURCEPAGE:Oriental Adventures	DESC:Once per day, you can add your shaman level to a single saving throw you make.
Hero (Shaman)	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Hero (Shaman)	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|Hero (Shaman)=1|Divine Favor|Hero (Shaman)=2|Bull's Strength|Hero (Shaman)=3|Protection from Energy|Hero (Shaman)=4|Divine Power|Hero (Shaman)=5|Righteous Might|Hero (Shaman)=6|Stoneskin|Hero (Shaman)=7|Transformation|Hero (Shaman)=9|Shapechange	SOURCEPAGE:Oriental Adventures	DESC:Once per day, you can add your shaman level to a single attack roll.
Knowledge (Shaman)	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Knowledge (Shaman)	CSKILL:TYPE=Knowledge	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|Knowledge (Shaman)=1|Detect Secret Doors|Knowledge (Shaman)=2|Detect Thoughts|Knowledge (Shaman)=3|Clairaudience/Clairvoyance|Knowledge (Shaman)=4|Divination|Knowledge (Shaman)=5|True Seeing|Knowledge (Shaman)=6|Find the Path|Knowledge (Shaman)=7|Legend Lore|Knowledge (Shaman)=8|Discern Location|Knowledge (Shaman)=9|Foresight	SOURCEPAGE:Oriental Adventures	DESC:All Knowledge skills are class skills. You cast divinations at +1 caster level.
Metal (Shaman)	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Metal (Shaman)	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|Metal (Shaman)=2|Heat Metal|Metal (Shaman)=4|Rusting Grasp|Metal (Shaman)=5|Wall of Iron|Metal (Shaman)=6|Blade Barrier|Metal (Shaman)=7|Move Earth|Metal (Shaman)=8|Repel Metal or Stone|Metal (Shaman)=9|Iron Body	SOURCEPAGE:Oriental Adventures	DESC:Metal ward, once per day (spell-like, standard action, abjuration): you or a creature touched gains damage reduction 1/- against attacks from metal weapons or spell effects for 1 minute + 1 minute/level.
Nature (Shaman)	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Nature (Shaman)	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|Nature (Shaman)=6|Transport via Plants|Nature (Shaman)=7|Control Weather|Nature (Shaman)=8|Animal Shapes|Nature (Shaman)=9|Shapechange	SOURCEPAGE:Oriental Adventures	DESC:Rebuke or command normal animals or plant creatures as an evil cleric rebukes or commands undead, 3 + Charisma modifier times per day.
River (Shaman)	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|River (Shaman)	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|River (Shaman)=1|Obscuring Mist|River (Shaman)=3|Water Breathing|River (Shaman)=4|Control Water|River (Shaman)=5|Ice Storm|River (Shaman)=7|Acid Fog|River (Shaman)=8|Horrid Wilting|River (Shaman)=9|Elemental Swarm	SOURCEPAGE:Oriental Adventures	DESC:Swim speed 30 feet (no water breathing); no Swim checks to swim normally; +8 on Swim checks for special actions or hazards, can always take 10 on them; can run while swimming in a straight line.
Stone (Shaman)	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Stone (Shaman)	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|Stone (Shaman)=1|Magic Stone|Stone (Shaman)=3|Stone Shape|Stone (Shaman)=4|Spike Stones|Stone (Shaman)=5|Wall of Stone|Stone (Shaman)=6|Stoneskin|Stone (Shaman)=7|Statue|Stone (Shaman)=8|Earthquake|Stone (Shaman)=9|Elemental Swarm	SOURCEPAGE:Oriental Adventures	DESC:Stone ward, once per day (spell-like, standard action, abjuration): you or a creature touched gains damage reduction 5/- against stone weapons, stone creatures (earth elementals, gargoyles, clay and stone golems), spell effects, or falling onto earth or stone, for 1 minute + 1 minute/level.
Travel (Shaman)	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Travel (Shaman)	CSKILL:Survival	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|Travel (Shaman)=1|Expeditious Retreat|Travel (Shaman)=2|Locate Object|Travel (Shaman)=3|Fly|Travel (Shaman)=4|Dimension Door|Travel (Shaman)=5|Teleport|Travel (Shaman)=6|Find the Path|Travel (Shaman)=7|Teleport (Greater)|Travel (Shaman)=8|Phase Door|Travel (Shaman)=9|Astral Projection	SOURCEPAGE:Oriental Adventures	DESC:For a total of 1 round per shaman level per day, you act normally regardless of magical effects that impede movement (as freedom of movement; supernatural, automatic). Survival is a class skill.
Trickery (Shaman)	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Trickery (Shaman)	CSKILL:Bluff|Disguise|Hide	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|Trickery (Shaman)=1|Disguise Self|Trickery (Shaman)=2|Invisibility|Trickery (Shaman)=3|Nondetection|Trickery (Shaman)=4|Confusion|Trickery (Shaman)=5|False Vision|Trickery (Shaman)=6|Mislead|Trickery (Shaman)=7|Screen|Trickery (Shaman)=8|Polymorph Any Object|Trickery (Shaman)=9|Time Stop	SOURCEPAGE:Oriental Adventures	DESC:Bluff, Disguise and Hide are class skills.
War (Shaman)	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|War (Shaman)	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|War (Shaman)=1|Magic Weapon|War (Shaman)=2|Spiritual Weapon|War (Shaman)=3|Magic Vestment|War (Shaman)=4|Divine Power|War (Shaman)=5|Flame Strike|War (Shaman)=6|Blade Barrier|War (Shaman)=7|Power Word Stun|War (Shaman)=8|Power Word Blind|War (Shaman)=9|Power Word Kill	SOURCEPAGE:Oriental Adventures	DESC:Free Martial Weapon Proficiency (if necessary) and Weapon Focus with a Small or Medium simple or martial melee weapon of your choice.
Wood (Shaman)	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Wood (Shaman)	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|Wood (Shaman)=2|Tree Shape|Wood (Shaman)=3|Speak with Plants|Wood (Shaman)=4|Control Plants|Wood (Shaman)=5|Tree Stride|Wood (Shaman)=6|Repel Wood|Wood (Shaman)=7|Ironwood|Wood (Shaman)=8|Changestaff|Wood (Shaman)=9|Command Plants	SOURCEPAGE:Oriental Adventures	DESC:Move through natural thorns, briars, overgrown areas and similar terrain at normal speed without damage or impairment (magically manipulated terrain still impedes).
